  "document": "A26693",
  "range": {
    "first": "A26693-zh-00065",
    "last": "A26693-zh-00102"
  },
  "checked_rows": 38,
  "corrected_rows": 19,
  "source_ko_blob_sha": "cf045f80edc2f938db0d4fe8220fd7d22754c72b",
  "source_zh_blob_sha": "6aba81b8dd9749b92f915ab8a9faf4b1d2cd399c",
  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00066",
      "source_hash": "5336eb6d7feefac33fe050c4f4223cc0fd0cd635bffdd3ac8187efc99d1e633b",
      "text": "中央人口贩运等受害者权益保护机构负责人依《防止人口贩运等及保护受害者等法施行令》第二十八条（敏感信息及唯一身份识别信息的处理）、"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00067",
      "source_hash": "76da8bfc88813d26ddbb94945c173a24d39a78cafdf7245ff68e1ec432a89662",
      "text": "《个人信息保护法》第十五条（个人信息的收集、利用）、第十七条（个人信息的提供）、第二十四条（唯一身份识别信息处理限制）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00068",
      "source_hash": "5044c65f8d95c7982b242c5c3db723260398aed59ab27e6a745690b4dd1cf588",
      "text": "及第二十四条之二（居民登记号码处理限制），为办理受害者确认书签发业务，按以下内容收集、利用"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00069",
      "source_hash": "4d8b77c36648e835348d4d0d374ee263e91bdb46d0d408876dc33a45dfb8ec15",
      "text": "和提供所需的个人信息。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00076",
      "source_hash": "0d5c709fee9218b19a186286f42003d06273ad9a869995b60757af3164f848eb",
      "text": "- 劳动合同等证明就业的资料"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00077",
      "source_hash": "190db5d2957d0b83b2d3fdd191ed360957479cd0afaff48eb4d5d6568cee59bb",
      "text": "- 其他能够证明其系人口贩运等受害者的资料"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00078",
      "source_hash": "7529e14e4ed29b7817d55ec595bf65a4311744877d6fd86e33e0dd34a92419cd",
      "text": "③ 个人信息保留和使用期限：自收到申请之日起保留五年。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00080",
      "source_hash": "c0fe7696c173f349c7cb8587730e787a42872406c15281e78cc0c73150c17054",
      "text": "- 接收方：地方人口贩运等受害者权益保护机构"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00081",
      "source_hash": "f064169d55f067450ee9ac4ca521378fc6557ffba0cdf9fdfa541e55205ddaeb",
      "text": "- 提供目的：调查人口贩运等受害案件、人口贩运等案件判定委员会审议及表决等。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00082",
      "source_hash": "f8cf67ffc8f79eca51a1654075c90765b1c2a7dcd1999c98eee52bf7de8a1068",
      "text": "■ 您有权拒绝同意收集、利用和提供个人信息；拒绝同意的，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00083",
      "source_hash": "7e229f9325a0e395329c15773387adab9bec438e4937bb6735da7ee3bdd3aca8",
      "text": "可能被排除在受害者确认书签发对象之外。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00084",
      "source_hash": "c28519fe22deaa1aae1901819a114efd6052659f25cb26bec0208cd904c74c24",
      "text": "■ 我们承诺遵守《个人信息保护法》要求个人信息处理者遵守的保护规定，依法尽最大努力保护有关人员的权益，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00085",
      "source_hash": "75fdc092f2ee83ee1f89e07b0bbfc4f8b703d74aaf3bb6f24635875e14212bea",
      "text": "并且绝不用于经许可的使用目的以外的其他用途。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00092",
      "source_hash": "813afb2c0f870ca3a7dd7106df662ee18cff5b3ccf7e2dce700078b8e61302e3",
      "text": "申请人姓名："
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00094",
      "source_hash": "2879222415672d201abfe3e634d8339e67e1459aae97a4f34b023760aaf0d94f",
      "text": "办理流程"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00095",
      "source_hash": "9d62579f9c9457be124f61b10c676805aeb34f2362e83bef4d7421781109bdd0",
      "text": "填写申请书"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00096",
      "source_hash": "d995d6ab415d91d191bafde064de400b1e66d82532d91ec0cc02d72258ce5cda",
      "text": "受理"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00099",
      "source_hash": "fc0aec8efc9cf7434964f86433311e24f2998ef6e36c7e3904222fa29065b276",
      "text": "签发"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00101",
      "source_hash": "6130db5071108dc0c004b420d658a03acd65ca384cad1e59ab7b27774e7e0ef9",
      "text": "办理机构（中央人口贩运等受害者权益保护机构）"
    }
  ],
  "note": "Compared last 38 Chinese form fragments with Korean privacy-consent section and workflow. Corrected implementing-decree/privacy-law citations, five-year retention basis, third-party recipient/purpose, consent refusal consequences and issuance workflow. Other labels and page dimensions maintained."
}